'' TKO0145: EVERY .bas IN A MODULE DIRECTORY IS A FILE OF THAT MODULE, so one without a
'' '#module' line is an error rather than a file whose meaning depends on how it was reached.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --print-graph -i tests/diagnostics/src/modules/stray/libs tests/diagnostics/src/modules/stray/main.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: stray.bas(1,1): error TKO0145: 'tests/diagnostics/src/modules/stray/libs/pk/m/stray.bas' is in module directory 'tests/diagnostics/src/modules/stray/libs/pk/m' but does not begin with '#module'
